\pnlcrm\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \widctlpar \f4\fs20 {\f5\cf4 Commander:
\par 
\par Something has gone horribly wrong.  We must evacuate the colony immediately.  All available Evacuation Transports have been filled to capacity and are ready to leave.
\par 
\par Our survivability projections have identified the vehicles and supplies we need to build a viable new colony.
\par 
\par Gather these materials and rendezvous at the mining beacon southeast of our colony.  An exact list of needed materials is available in the Specific Objectives.
\par 
\par Hurry, Commander.  Time is running out.}
\par }